  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e08-scene-06",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "やるのかやらないのかどっちだ  (Will You Do It, or Not?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaede": "楓",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "student": "生徒"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inspired by Kuroki, new actresses line up at Muranishi's studio as the crew shoots fifteen videos in five days and a nervous Student is promoted to director, while Kaede ramps up Poseidon's production fivefold. Listen for \"ryousan\", mass production.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "五日で十五本撮りって新記録っすよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "女優はそろったんだな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "はい、女優の締め出しなくなったみたいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今週のスケジュールは？来週から東京で三本撮るぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もっと撮影入れろ。お前も監督やれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ、いや、あの、それは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やるのかやらないのか、どっちだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "やります！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "年内の制作本数を大幅に増やします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "今後は全作品に社長のチェックが入ります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "撮影前のコンセプト、絵コンテの提出は必須でお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "制作費はこれまでの五倍かけて量産していくぞ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "五日で十五本撮りって新記録っすよね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shooting fifteen videos in five days has got to be a new record.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "女優はそろったんだな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have all the actresses lined up, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "はい、女優の締め出しなくなったみたいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, it looks like the industry freeze-out against us is gone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今週のスケジュールは？来週から東京で三本撮るぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this week's schedule? Starting next week we shoot three in Tokyo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もっと撮影入れろ。お前も監督やれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pack in even more shoots. You direct a film too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ、いや、あの、それは…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Wait, well, I mean...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やるのかやらないのか、どっちだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you going to do it or not—which is it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "やります！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will do it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "年内の制作本数を大幅に増やします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will sharply increase the number of productions before year's end.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "今後は全作品に社長のチェックが入ります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From now on, the president will review every single production.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "撮影前のコンセプト、絵コンテの提出は必須でお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Submitting pre-shoot concepts and storyboards is mandatory.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "制作費はこれまでの五倍かけて量産していくぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will spend five times our previous budget and mass-produce!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
